        "recommended": true,
        "obligatory": false
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2916,
      "text": "Blessed is He Who placed in the sky constellations and placed therein a radiant lamp[35] and a luminous moon.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 365,
      "ruku": 315,
      "hizbQuarter": 146,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2917,
      "text": "It is He Who made the night and the day to follow each other so that everyone who wishes may reflect or become grateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 365,
      "ruku": 315,
      "hizbQuarter": 146,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2918,
      "text": "The slaves of the Most Compassionate are those who walk on earth humbly[36], and when the ignorant address them, they only say words of peace[37];",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
